        <detaileddescription>
<para>This cannot go into the constructor because it starts a thread which calls <computeroutput><ref refid="classILLIXR_1_1zed__imu__thread_1a7a91866d0b46f53edf531ad762726798" kindref="member">_p_one_iteration()</ref></computeroutput> which is virtual in the child class.</para>
